    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "Adolescence is the stage between childhood and adulthood, roughly 10 to 19 years. The body grows quickly and the body changes because of hormones.\nWe need a balanced diet, regular exercise, enough sleep and good hygiene. Feelings may change quickly, so talking to elders and friends helps.\nWe should avoid harmful substances and learn to say no to pressure."
    }
